# Only the public website is tracked in this repo.
# Everything else (strategy docs, PDFs, design references, personal photos) stays local.
# Exception: CLAUDE.md and .claude/ are operating config for Claude Code itself,
# not project content — they need to persist in git so future sessions inherit them.
# Exception: content-vault/ is the production system for Beyond the Pitch content
# (scripts, storyboards, source calendar/playbook) — it needs to persist in git too,
# not live only in one local session.
*
!*.html
!assets/
!assets/*.png
!.gitignore
!CNAME
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!content-vault/
!content-vault/**
